{"seq":97,"slug":"write-ahead-logging-recovery","title":"预写日志与崩溃恢复","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"预写日志与崩溃恢复-总览\">预写日志与崩溃恢复·总览</h1><p>数据库在写一行数据之前，先把&quot;我打算这么改&quot;记进一条顺序追加的日志——这条看似多余的规则，是几乎所有持久化系统在断电、进程被杀、内核 panic 之后还能把数据救回来的根基。这个 hub 讲的就是这条规则：预写日志（Write-Ahead Logging, WAL）为什么有效，它的日志长什么样，崩溃后系统如何凭这份日志把自己拉回一致状态，以及真实数据库（Postgres、MySQL）把它工程化到了什么程度。</p>\n<p>四个章节是一条递进的主线，建议顺序阅读。<strong>基础</strong>回答&quot;为什么不能直接把脏页刷盘了事&quot;——把随机写换成顺序写、把原子性和持久性拆开来满足，并定义贯穿全 hub 的核心物件：日志序列号 LSN。<strong>日志机制</strong>讲日志里到底记什么：redo 与 undo 两类信息、检查点如何缩短恢复窗口、force/steal 缓冲策略如何决定你必须记 redo 还是 undo。<strong>恢复</strong>是这个 hub 的重心——ARIES 算法用&quot;先无脑重演历史、再精确撤销&quot;的反直觉思路，配合分析-重做-撤销三阶段和模糊检查点，把恢复做成一个可证明正确、可重入的过程。<strong>实践</strong>落到地面：Postgres 18 的异步 I/O 与 MySQL 8.4 的 redo log、组提交如何用一次 fsync 摊薄上千笔事务的代价，以及 WAL 早已溢出&quot;恢复&quot;本职、成为复制与 CDC 的数据源。</p>\n<p><strong>与兄弟 hub 的分工边界。</strong> 本 hub 只深讲 <strong>WAL 本身与 ARIES 风格的崩溃恢复</strong>，不重复邻居的内容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../database-transactions-concurrency/\">数据库事务与并发控制（29）</a>讲 ACID 的隔离性、锁、MVCC、可串行化——也就是事务&quot;并发时如何不互相踩&quot;。本 hub 只用到它的 D（持久性）和 A（原子性），隔离性一律点到为止。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../storage-engines-internals/\">存储引擎内幕（39）</a>讲 B+ 树、LSM、缓冲池、页布局——数据&quot;静态时如何摆放&quot;。本 hub 关心的是修改这些结构时如何记日志、崩溃后如何修复，不展开索引结构本身。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../database-replication-ha/\">数据库复制与高可用（58）</a>和<a href=\"../consensus-algorithms-raft-paxos/\">共识算法（96）</a>把 WAL 当成上游数据源继续往下游传，那是 WAL 的&quot;超越恢复&quot;用途，本 hub 在最后一篇点出接口，细节留给它们。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径。</strong> 数据库使用者或后端工程师想搞懂&quot;为什么数据库重启不丢数据&quot;，按 基础 → 日志机制 → 恢复 顺序读完前九篇即可；想调优生产库的人可以从<a href=\"practice/wal-in-databases\">数据库中的 WAL</a>和<a href=\"practice/group-commit-throughput\">组提交与吞吐</a>倒着读，遇到不懂的概念再回前面查；做 CDC、事件溯源、流处理的人直接跳到<a href=\"practice/wal-replication-beyond\">复制与超越恢复的用途</a>，再按需回溯。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识。</strong> 你需要知道操作系统的页缓存与 fsync 大致在做什么、磁盘顺序写远快于随机写、以及事务&quot;要么全做要么全不做&quot;的直觉。不需要预先懂 ARIES——那正是本 hub 要教的。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-wal","title":"为何需要 WAL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/foundations/why-wal"},{"seq":2,"slug":"durability-atomicity","title":"持久性与原子性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/foundations/durability-atomicity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"log-structure-lsn","title":"日志结构与 LSN","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/foundations/log-structure-lsn"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"logging","title":"日志机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/logging","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"redo-undo-logging","title":"redo 与 undo 日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/logging/redo-undo-logging"},{"seq":2,"slug":"checkpointing","title":"检查点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/logging/checkpointing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"force-steal-policies","title":"刷盘策略 force/steal","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/logging/force-steal-policies"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"recovery","title":"恢复","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/recovery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aries-recovery","title":"ARIES 恢复算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/recovery/aries-recovery"},{"seq":2,"slug":"analysis-redo-undo","title":"分析-重做-撤销三阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/recovery/analysis-redo-undo"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fuzzy-checkpoint-recovery","title":"模糊检查点与恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/recovery/fuzzy-checkpoint-recovery"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wal-in-databases","title":"数据库中的 WAL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/practice/wal-in-databases"},{"seq":2,"slug":"group-commit-throughput","title":"组提交与吞吐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/practice/group-commit-throughput"},{"seq":3,"slug":"wal-replication-beyond","title":"复制与超越恢复的用途","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/practice/wal-replication-beyond"}]}]}